# Ford Sierra Mk3 (Sapphire) four-door saloon, 1993.
#
# The final Sierra facelift of February 1993: body-colour grille, revised lamps and
# trims, sold alongside the new Mondeo for one season before the Sierra range was
# withdrawn from the British market. 4,468 mm long, 1,694 mm wide, 1,399 mm high,
# 2,603 mm wheelbase. Modelled as the booted Sapphire, as that was the volume body
# by 1993.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ford_Sierra
#
# Colours: Diamond White, Rosso Red and Graphite Grey are documented Ford colours
# of 1993.
#
# Weight: 80 in total (white 30, red 30, grey 20); a single-season model, so low.
#
# Speed 195 km/h; comfort 130/375 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1993-2002, the tail covering the cars' later life on British roads.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/ford-sierra-mk3.blend. References:
# citycars/references/ford-sierra-mk3/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

